	quests: [
		{
			title: "Out of the Way"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Time for Good News, Bad News."
				""
				"&dGood News: You have an easy way to get to Runandor that you may have already found!"
				""
				"&5Bad news: You can't make a Runandor Realmstone to get there from your Base without first visiting Runandor and getting some materials."
				""
				"&dIt's so weird, they changed it to be both easier and harder to get there. Except they also forgot Waystones are part of their system..."
				""
				"&5Well, unless you were lucky with the Blind Box system pipe, you'll need to go to Mysterium, and find one of the Runic Portal Hallows to get to Runandor."
				""
				"&dWell, welcome to Runandor. A blue and magical world, one highly protected by the FOP. Watch your step, and keep your eyes open, Bandit."
			]
			dependencies: ["75E5C04EF025BBD3"]
			id: "14EE74768D644D7E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4CFEFBDD4D69C158"
				type: "dimension"
				dimension: "aoa3:runandor"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5FFD5FEF4522E106"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2245246540467579945L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Going Around"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5To get the Runandor Realmstone, you'll need a Runic Energy from inside Runandor. You'll also need a few things from Mysterium."
				""
				"&dA Vox Light, which is easy to get, and an Active Rune Stone, which is a bit harder. You need to find Shield Golems, and fight them until they put up a shield. When you hit the shield, Active Rune Stones pop out, which you usually use to take down said Shield."
				""
				"&5Also, don't forget a Blank Runestone. Head into Mysterium, place the Vox Light down, and toss the Runic Energy and Blank Realmstone on top of it. Then activate the Vox Light by Right Clicking the Active Rune Stone onto it."
			]
			dependencies: ["14EE74768D644D7E"]
			id: "70B6EB61CC5D03B6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "44147A5430430B7F"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:runandor_realmstone"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "53DC74CEC5206A5B"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2245246540467579945L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Magic Metal"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Deep under the land of Runandor, you can find a magical metal called Elecanium. It is pretty powerful."
				""
				"&dA lot of the inhabitants of this land work for the FOP. Direct subordinates to the Boss of Runandor. They will be on the search for as much as they can find."
				""
				"&5Also seems some of them have already extracted some of the magical energy from the world, and have it stored in an item. "
				""
				"&dAptly named \"Runic Energy\" of course."
			]
			dependencies: ["14EE74768D644D7E"]
