			description: [
				"&5Rune Templars are hostile creatures that spawn in Runic Rooms underground in Runandor."
				""
				"&5Runic Templars start inactive. You can Right Click a Water, Fire, Poison, or Energy Rune onto one, then a Runic Energy to activate and fight it."
				""
				"&5While fighting, Runic Templars will spawn Runic Lifeforms to heal them and Weaken you."
				""
				"&5When defeated, Runic Templars will drop Mega Rune Fragments of the same color you activated them as."
