		{
			title: "Ruler of Magic"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Another on the Board of Directors sits as the leader of this magical land."
				""
				"&dClunkhead has a stranglehold on this magic world. You can see it with all of their minions. The templars, the fake angels, the false paladins. "
				""
				"&5Dethroning them will not be easy. Heck, even getting an audience with them is a process. You'll need to summon and defeat a Runic Templar of each color."
				""
				"&dThe Rune Templars spawn in Runic Rooms, which are found near the bottom of the world. You'll need Runic Energy, and Water, Fire, Poison, and Energy Runes to activate them."
				""
				"&5You'll need one of each color Mega Rune Fragment. Then combine them into the Mega Rune Stone."
			]
